			(property "Description" "The PD0922J5050S2HF is a low profile, sub-miniature Wilkinson power divider in an easy to use surface mount package. The PD0922J5050S2HF is matched to 50 Ω and has a height profile of 0.5 mm which is ideal for high level integrations in the following markets: DVB-S, DVB-H (USA), GSM, DCS, PCS, CDMA, 3G and GPS. The PD0922J5050S2HF does not include the resistive element and therefore, requires an external resistor for operation."
